about political authority and freedom.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7eb3-8e47-70e0532e9966","description":"Jean-Jacques Rousseau","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7e9a-b0d6-bc45f5bd61e8","description":"Jean-Paul Sartre","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7e8e-b811-c6259e5fcacc","description":"Spinoza","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7c61-b38a-573b26335fcd","description":"Ludwig Wittgenstein","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-799b-aab4-5b230bf8fed2","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these Latin phrases means \'Lead in order to serve, not in order to rule\'?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Praesis ut prosis ne ut imperes frames leadership as a duty to help others, rather than a license to command.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7eb8-af8c-fdef8fc324c7","description":"Praesis ut prosis ne ut imperes","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-75db-88bd-a510deae17ec","description":"Libertas perfundet omnia luce","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-791a-9c93-7c05e12c026b","description":"Non loqui sed facere","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7798-b512-02ba67e91956","description":"Carpe diem","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7647-9962-6f36808f5924","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What organisation is based in the Lubjlyanka building?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The FSB is Russia\'s domestic security and counterintelligence agency, and it succeeded the KGB after the Soviet Union dissolved.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7c17-96f8-9fe621fd38bb","description":"The FSB","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-71bc-99bd-69ad96b57be1","description":"The EU","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-757e-96a2-04bc4d160ce9","description":"The WHO","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7063-baab-562802877a52","description":"Interpol","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7e76-b979-4441fe6