ces","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7a50-a72e-7b45d88fba8b","description":"Theatrical performances","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7a42-8d92-6c537d4c283f","description":"Magic shows","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-702f-b615-f04524c1e249","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Tamil is a language spoken in which of these countries?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Sri Lanka recognizes Tamil as an official language alongside Sinhala, reflecting its Tamil-speaking community.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7d60-8b6d-cb16f6584f33","description":"Sri Lanka","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-792b-b63b-f63148c1809c","description":"Uganda","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7f57-89cc-9bb8a6c847c7","description":"Taiwan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7c74-b43f-7d5f2ff20bba","description":"Algeria","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-73d0-9504-1bf19f585ff3","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What do the Amish traditionally use instead of buttons to fasten coats and vests?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The Amish fasten coats and vests with hooks and eyes rather than buttons, which they view as ornamental.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7647-b8ee-77f0c157d22e","description":"Hooks and eyes","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7ebe-a62e-e8629ebe494e","description":"Buckles","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7517-85c5-b5d759531dfd","description":"Laces","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7456-a5db-39e37f8bf4da","description":"Zippers","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7d54-a200-77d15101c895","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these is a model of car made by Alfa Romeo?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Alfa Romeo first used the Giulietta name for a compact car in the 1950s and later revived it for newer models.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad6c-7e04-8c3